<title>USA: Praxair Inc sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Praxair Inc sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Praxair Inc was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER Praxair Inc</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	  COUPON 6.90	 MATURITY 11/01/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A3	 YIELD  6.90	 PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P   BBB-PLUS SPREAD 52 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859 1670</p>
</text>
